Ply: this repository's Verify scripts read Cargo build output through
CARGO_TARGET_DIR (scripts/build-sidecar.sh, scripts/verify-build.sh), so a
card's Verify may build into the workspace's shared Cargo target
(.atelier-worktrees/.cargo-target). Remove this file if a script Verify runs
starts reading a fixed target/ path. See docs/STATUS.md (#53).
